WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.910
The critics have spoken, and there's an overwhelming
consensus—Lady Bird is good.

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.240
The movie is so good, in fact, that not a
single one of the 170 reviewers registered

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.490
with Rotten Tomatoes made a negative judgment
about the film.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:19.620
As a result, not only does the movie boast
an impressive 100% score on Rotten Tomatoes,

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.930
but the sheer volume of positive reviews has
led the movie to become the highest-rated

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.890
movie ever in the website's 19-year history.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.910
"That we know of yet."

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:34.461
The winsome story of a Catholic teen's coming-of-age
in 2002, Lady Bird stars Saoirse Ronan as

00:00:34.461 --> 00:00:40.260
Christine "Lady Bird" McPherson, a 17-year-old
girl in Sacramento who navigates life, love

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.079
and family drama on her way out of high school
and onward to New York.

00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:48.770
The movie's unprecedented success with reviewers
since its premiere on September 1st has resulted

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:53.260
in the dethroning of the site's previously
highest-rated movie, Toy Story 2, which was

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.239
released in 1999.

00:00:55.239 --> 00:01:00.800
That movie notched a 100% score as well, but
only 163 reviews were recorded toward that

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.320
rating.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.320
"Somebody do something!"

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:07.560
It was a marvelous run for the Pixar classic,
but the crowning of a new champion is an absolute

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:12.470
triumph for filmmaker Greta Gerwig, a 34-year-old
writer and actress making her directorial

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:13.470
debut.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:16.260
It's hard to imagine how she could've made
a better first impression.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:21.610
Previously, Gerwig gained notice for co-writing
and starring in Frances Ha and Mistress America,

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:25.729
as well as her recent appearances in 20th
Century Women and Jackie as a performer.

00:01:25.729 --> 00:01:30.140
Ronan, around whose performance the film revolves,
will be seen next year starring in the films

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.190
On Chesil Beach, The Seagull, and Mary Queen
of Scots.

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.479
"What if this IS the best version?"

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:37.570
Gerwig said of her record-setting accomplishment:

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:42.970
"This is completely amazing and so incredibly
appreciated by the entire team that made Lady

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:43.970
Bird."

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.530
"We put our heart and souls into this movie,
and the last step of this deeply collaborative

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:51.450
art form of filmmaking is giving the film
to the audience and the film critics."

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:54.929
"That there has been such a warm reception
is a dream come true.

00:01:54.929 --> 00:01:58.640
Thank you to everyone who has seen the film
and has written about it so thoughtfully.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:03.079
We are all on cloud nine and using our tomato
emoji more than we ever thought possible."

00:02:03.079 --> 00:02:07.090
Who'd have guessed that such a sweet little
indie drama from a debut director could achieve

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:08.090
so much.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:10.369
"Who the f--- is on top their first time?"

00:02:10.369 --> 00:02:11.369
Thanks for watching!

